# The root .gitignore has `*.log`, which swallowed every fixture in this
# directory. docs/trace-invariants.md says "the fixtures are committed, not
# generated at test time: a test whose input is built by the same file that
# builds the tool is testing itself" — and they were not committed, so on a
# fresh clone `test_every_invariant_has_a_fixture_that_violates_it` would fail
# for all 37 checks. These are synthetic logs, not runtime output.
!*.log
